Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "TrafficLightDistractionScenario" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 ;
    :occursInScene :scene1 .

:weather1 a :DayCondition .

:risk1 a :DistractionRisk ;
    :description "Billboard display mimicking a traffic light signal" ;
    :confidenceScore "0.75"^^xsd:float ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.65"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: A billboard on the left displays an image of a green traffic light, which may distract or mislead an autonomous system into interpreting it as a real traffic control signal.
Severity Score: 0.65